# 仓库内一律以 LF 存储并检出：全局 core.autocrlf=true 会把工作区改成 CRLF，
# 而本项目（含被 Web UI 内嵌的 data/web/index.html）约定全部 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不参与行尾与编码转换
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.a binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dat binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
